luid or dietary fiber intake, less physical activity, concurrent use of certain medications, levels of thyroid hormone and progesterone, and a wide range of medical conditions including neurodegenerative diseases (Leung 2007; Leung et al. 2011).", citationTitle:"Environ Health Perspect. 2013 Nov-Dec;121(11-12):1245-52. doi: 10.1289/ehp.1306967. Epub 2013 Aug 7.", annotationSubgraph:["Synuclein subgraph"], annotationMeshdisease:["Constipation"], pmid:"23933572", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"23933572"}}, {start: {_id:1210}, end: {_id:1204}, properties:{evidence:"Other suspected risk factors for constipation include inadequate fluid or dietary fiber intake, less physical activity, concurrent use of certain medications, levels of thyroid hormone and progesterone, and a wide range of medical conditions including neurodegenerative diseases (Leung 2007; Leung et al. 2011).", citationTitle:"Environ Health Perspect. 2013 Nov-Dec;121(11-12):1245-52. doi: 10.1289/ehp.1306967. Epub 2013 Aug 7.", annotationSubgraph:["Synuclein subgraph"], annotationMeshdisease:["Constipation"], pmid:"23933572", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"23933572"}}, {start: {_id:1278}, end: {_id:16}, properties:{evidence:"Studies indicate that exposure to dieldrin is closely associated with Parkinson's disease", citationTitle:"Mol Pharmacol. 2010 Apr;77(4):621-32. doi: 10.1124/mol.109.062174. Epub 2010 Jan 22.", annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationMeshdisease:["Parkinson Disease"], pmid:"20097775", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"20097775"}}] AS row
