creasingly linked to neurodegeneration and Parkinson's disease (PD) neuropathology", citationTitle:"Neurobiol Dis. 2015 Feb;74:180-93. doi: 10.1016/j.nbd.2014.11.015. Epub 2014 Dec 3.", annotationSubgraph:["Ubiquitin subgraph"], annotationMeshdisease:["Parkinson Disease"], pmid:"25478815", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"25478815"}}] AS row
