doi: 10.1038/cdd.2014.224. Epub 2015 Jan 16.", annotationSubgraph:["PINK1 subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Mitochondria"], pmid:"25591737", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"25591737"}}, {start: {_id:24}, end: {_id:1717}, properties:{annotationCondition:["Normal Healthy State"], evidence:"Parkin and PINK1 cooperate in a biochemical mitochondrial quality control pathway regulating mitochondrial morphology, dynamics and clearance.", citationTitle:"Cell Death Differ. 2015 Oct;22(10):1563-76. doi: 10.1038/cdd.2014.224. Epub 2015 Jan 16.", annotationSubgraph:["Ubiquitin subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Mitochondria"], pmid:"25591737", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"25591737"}}, {start: {_id:1304}, end: {_id:1717}, properties:{annotationCondition:["Normal Healthy State"], evidence:"Parkin and PINK1 cooperate in a biochemical mitochondrial quality control pathway regulating mitochondrial morphology, dynamics and clearance.", citationTitle:"Cell Death Differ. 2015 Oct;22(10):1563-76. doi: 10.1038/cdd.2014.224. Epub 2015 Jan 16.", annotationSubgraph:["PINK1 subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Mitochondria"], pmid:"25591737", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"25591737"}}, {start: {_id:24}, end: {_id:1926}, properties:{annotationCondition:["Normal Healthy State"], evidence:"To date, only one study reported possible involvement of parkin in Ca2+ homeostasis", citationTitle:"Biochim Biophys Acta. 2013 Apr;1832(4):495-508. doi: 10.1016/j.bbadis.2013.01.004. Epub 2013 Jan 9.", annotationSubgraph:["Ubiquitin subgraph"], pmid:"23313576", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"23313576"}}, {start: {_id:24}, end: {_id:1929}, properties:{annotationCondition:["Normal Healthy State"], evidence:"The rate of mitochondrial ATP synthesis in parkin overexpressing cells could keep pace with that of ATP translocation from mitochon- dria to cytoplasm, thus making changes in mitochondrial ATP similar to those measured in control cells.", citationTitle:"Biochim Biophys Acta. 2013 Apr;1