arkinson disease).It has also been reported that expression of b1-AR is increased significantly in the colonic mucous of 6-OHDA rats(Rat model of Parkinson disease)", citationTitle:"Transl Res. 2014 Jul;164(1):22-31. doi: 10.1016/j.trsl.2014.01.001. Epub 2014 Jan 7.", annotationSpecies:["10116"], annotationMeshdisease:["Parkinson Disease"], pmid:"24467967", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24467967"}}, {start: {_id:1295}, end: {_id:1291}, properties:{evidence:"we observed that the TT variant of the methylenetetrahydrofolate reductase C677T polymorphism is associated with an increased risk for Parkinson's disease in smokers.", citationTitle:"Ann Neurol. 2005 Jun;57(6):927-30.", annotationSubgraph:["Folate metabolic subgraph"], annotationSpecies:["9606"], annotationMeshdisease:["Parkinson Disease"], pmid:"15929053", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"15929053"}}] AS row
