tron of AIF, causing a reduction of its expression, the defect in CHCHD4 becomes evident before a major reduction of respiratory chain complex I is detect- able at the postnatal stage.", citationTitle:"Mol Cell. 2015 Jun 18;58(6):1001-14. doi: 10.1016/j.molcel.2015.04.020. Epub 2015 May 21.", annotationSubgraph:["Apoptosis signaling subgraph", "Chaperone subgraph"], pmid:"26004228", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"26004228"}}] AS row
